/* The look, taken from the dashboard on stacked.com: a near-black page, cards one step lighter with hairline borders
   and no shadows, a grayscale ramp for type, white primary buttons, sentence-case labels, and status shown as a small
   colored dot inside an outlined pill rather than a tinted fill. The base rules above set structure; these set the look.
   <html> always carries data-style=stacked so these outrank the base rules without a rewrite of their specificity. */
